<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>English premier league after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>6 - Fabrizio Ravnelli (Middlesbrough)</p>
<p>5 - Les Ferdinand (Newcastle)</p>
<p>4 - Kevin Campbell (Nottingham Forest), Eric Cantona </p>
<p>(Manchester United), Juninho (Middlesbrough)</p>
<p>3 - Chris Armstrong (Tottenham), Richie Humphreys</p>
<p>(Sheffield Wednesday), Steve McManaman (Liverpool),</p>
<p>Alan Shearer (Newcastle), Tommy Johnson (Aston Villa),</p>
<p>Paul Merson (Arsenal), Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
</text>
